      <Placemark>
        <name>Wasatch</name>
        <description><![CDATA[Loading point for granite from the quarries; junction of later standard gauge Salt Lake & Alta and narrow gauge Little Cottonwood Transportation Co.; location taken from 1936 D&RGW map of Wasatch, shown in N 1/2 of NE 1/4 of Section 7. End of SG track at engineering station 535+74 (53,574 feet; 10.14 miles).]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-22</styleUrl>
        <Point>
